# pall8t builds .pall8t/Containerfile with the project root as the build
# context, and apple/container reads the ignore file from here (next to the
# Containerfile), not from a root .dockerignore.
# The Containerfile COPYs nothing, so ship nothing: keeps node_modules/ out of
# the builder and .dev.vars (TYPESAFE_API_KEY) out of the image build.
*
